      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can you give me a more concrete example of how that looks in practice? like, if you had a situation where a group of white suburbanites were blocking a highway to protest a new tax, vs a group of young black men in a city center breaking windows during a protest about police conduct... how would the headlines or the descriptions of those two events typically differ in a mainstream news report?",
